--------------CUT HERE----------------


THE LAST TO DO iS TO COPY THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEVE TO YOUR BBS. THEN
EDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLES" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}. YOU WiLL FiND THEM iN 'BBS:MODULES/ABSTURZ/COECP'.

AT LAST COPY THE 'DODELAY'-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE
LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.

@ENDNODE

@NODE CONFiGFiLES "HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiGFiLES?"

1. GEHEN.CFG
 
   - iN THS FiLE ARE SOME iMPORTANT iNFORMATiONS WHiCH ARE NEEDED BY THE
     DOOR.

     1st Line = NAME OF YOUR BBS
     2nd Line = CHAT-OVERiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL

     E.G.:


     - Line 1 = KEY WEST BBS
     - Line 2 = 250


2. GREETiNGS.TXT

     - THESE ARE YOUR PERSONAL GREETiNGS.

     E.G.:

     - Line 1 = SPiDER/OSiRiS - THANX FOR THE SUPPORT.
     - Line 2 = DOC iCE/TSB   - THANX FOR YOUR SOURCES.
     - Line 3 = BLAH BLAH BLAH

     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY LiNES AS YOU MiGHT WANT.

   
3. BBSLiST.TXT

     - THiS iS A LiST OF SOME BBS'S.

     E.G.:

     - Line 1 = FUN FACTORY      - OSiRiS WHQ   - +1-619-263-5087
     - Line 2 = KEY WEST         - OSiRiS EHQ   -   +49-ASK-ELiTE
     - Line 3 = TRADE iN CENTER  - OSiRiS GHQ   -   +49-ASK-ELiTE

     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY LiNES AS YOU MiGHT WANT.


@ENDNODE       

